  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4df0014cb02a0cf4bbbc7addabd2224a, type: 3}
  m_Name: IntroShopDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: Ho ho! I see you've slain all the skeletons and are a bit stronger. Seems
      like you're not THAT useless after all. Congrats. Yay.
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: 'Now, as you can see, this here''s my lil'' shop. Remember those purple
      orbs I told you about?  '
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: You can use them to buy all kinds of things in this establishment.
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: 'You know, those same ones you use in crafting, and others that are exclusive
      to this store. '
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: So, as a reward for not being completely useless, I'll let you grab a cool
      new power with a discount.
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: Click on me to open up the store window! After you get your new power,
      we will talk more.
